<< /A << /BBox [ 63.4394 434.608 531.383 761.443 ] /O /Layout >> /Alt (Infographic summarizing an evidence-to-decision synthesis for radiopharmaceutical therapy. Panel A shows eight non-ordinal domains: quantitative fidelity, reference-standard appropriateness, external or prospective validation, clinical-endpoint relevance, dose-response or dose-toxicity linkage, workflow and human oversight, uncertainty and quality assurance, and decision impact. Panel B shows a pathway from human-led reference care through technical, internal, external, and prospective AI validation to decision-impact evaluation and monitored implementation. An evidence snapshot identifies 73 direct full journal reports, seven with external-type held-out evaluation, and none prospectively evaluating an AI-guided treatment policy or its effects on patient-level decisions or outcomes. The synthesis is not a validated score or framework.) /K 19 /Lang (en-EN) /P 23 0 R /Pg 268 0 R /S /Figure /Type /StructElem >>
